  open('/app/output/NOTES.md','w').write('- Rhythmic leg and shoulder motion enters inversion; a transition to individually tuned joint targets raises and steadies the feet.\n- Optimised episode-wide torso inversion, feet height, and actuator-force measures from physical state.\n- Constant poses stayed upright. Symmetric swing-and-hold targets twisted against the bar; individual joint tuning improves the hold.\n- Inverted LQR tests worked near the reference but did not provide a reliable swing-up.\n- Physical measure %.3f over %d steps; final torso vertical component %.3f, feet %.3f m.\n'%(hist[:,-1].sum(),len(hist),1-2*hist[-1,0],hist[-1,1]))

